1 FACT From Findagrave;
2 CONT
2 CONT Third son of William Riddell (16 Jul 1764, Orange Co., VA-1825/6) and Joicy Neal (11 Nov 1776, IRE-23 May 1836). They married on 27 Dec 1783.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: 12
2 CONT Charles Riddell (15 May 1784-4 Jun 1785)
2 CONT Cornelius Riddell (20 Mar 1786-20 Mar 1786)
2 CONT James Riddell (27 Aug 1790-24 May 1826) m. Sallie M. Craig
2 CONT Lucy Riddell (18 Nov 1792-11 May 1822) m. Simeon Christy
2 CONT William Riddell (8 Jun 1796-19 Jun 1818) never married
2 CONT Neal Riddell (28 May 1798) m. 4 times
2 CONT Valentine Riddell (3 May 1800-11 Jan 1834) m. 2 times
2 CONT Sally Riddell (28 Apr 1802-24 Jun 1823) m. Wesley Mitchell
2 CONT John Riddell (17 May 1804-11 Feb 1865) m. Florenda McKay #73699456
2 CONT Fountain (9 May 1806/7-16 Jul 1875) #21996598
2 CONT Elizabeth Riddell (1 Apr 1808- ?) unmarried
2 CONT Madison Riddell (9 Apr 1811-4 Apr 1849) m. Francis G. Fowler
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT (1) Mildred Kirtley on 20 Sep 1809, Boone Co., KY. Mildred died on Friday 19 Jun 1818, Burlington, Boone Co., KY.
2 CONT (2) Sarah Ann Leathers on 8 Oct 1818, Campbell Co., KY. Sarah died before April 1819, shortly after their marriage.
2 CONT (3) Ann Chambers on 1 Apr 1819, Boone Co., KY. Ann died on 16 May 1828 , Boone Co., KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT Melicent Riddell (7 Aug 1810-24 Sep 1844) m. John Piatt #15529468
2 CONT Madaline Riddell (1817) m. Richard Jacob Latimer (1812-1862) #73699440 aft. 1827.
2 CONT Joicy Ann Riddell (d. 4 Jun 1832) m. Mr. Stephens
2 CONT Charles James Riddell (17 May 1822–8 Jun 1840) unmarried #32158515
2 CONT Lafayette Riddell (22 Nov 1824-19 Jun 1842) #32158528
2 CONT Mary Jane Riddell (1826–1844) m. John Smith Bush #32158446
2 CONT Lewis Riddell (died young and unmarried)
2 CONT Ann Riddell
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a man of good education, for his day; was Judge of Boone County Court, and was several times elected to the Kentucky Legislature, and was a very popular man. Died while living in Burlington, KY.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1820 Census (Burlington, Boone Co., KY)
